                        <field name="dc_title">The Hon. Mr. Pedro Cevallos, first Secretary of State and the Office,..., through the Ilmo. Mr. Dean, the Royal Order following [Printed Text]: Ilmo. Mr. With the date of July 12 he tells me: “To duly fulfill the object that the King has proposed in the important issue of the arrangement of tariffs of the Kingdom, it has been useful to send that the Board appointed to this effect ask the Intendants, Consulates,... all the essential data to know the state of our agricultural, manufacturing and commercial industry,...” </field>
